#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf765-wing.rst:153
#: 5113a202378441518adf0b4d8e3cb46e
msgid "set :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` to \"2\" to change RTS7 and CTS7 pins to GPIO 1 and 2, respectively."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf765-wing.rst:154
